    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t2204",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 768,
      "width": 1820,
      "height": 22,
      "text": "Build frontier: the Platform-Admin onboarding plane, pulled ahead of the wrapper/runtime/project-admin tracks. Amber = code built + unit-tested (not yet live); green = live on the platform today. Onboarding verifies each capability the way a Project Admin consumes it: MCP = virtual server + scoped token (200 + 403 isolation); LLM = scoped budgeted/rate-limited key.",
      "originalText": "Build frontier: the Platform-Admin onboarding plane, pulled ahead of the wrapper/runtime/project-admin tracks. Amber = code built + unit-tested (not yet live); green = live on the platform today. Onboarding verifies each capability the way a Project Admin consumes it: MCP = virtual server + scoped token (200 + 403 isolation); LLM = scoped budgeted/rate-limited key.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
